{"date":"2026-10-04","on_shelf":[],"presented_event_with_attribution":"Ramesh says: “Ji sir, aap aaram se khaayein. Main bas bahar aata hoon.” Ramesh pauses at the doorway, glances back once to check he is settled, and steps out into the morning air.","prior_record_files":{"2026-10-02":"cf7a480104e051a2d1be3dbcabed4381a58ef96ec30bdc6002134b76cbd995c8","2026-10-03":"988ad816613474bcea5dddd7b897674b951aaa4bd9a7b163222f1d6b4d8eff67"},"reference":"1d3e25dadef114961149f9e23ec161b1d574df854cc5d1e696eb8f9ffa25caef","time":"08:05","typed_records":[{"amount":1500,"canonical_id":null,"creditor":"Ramesh","direction":"out","id":"2026-10-04:payment:b290d82c8b989205:1","item":"Groceries for Ramesh's kitchen","kind":"payment","medium":"cash","payer":null,"place":"home","settled":true,"source":{"collection":"entries","index":0,"sha256":"b290d82c8b989205adf8f38d7d846c4e2ec00e159c0cdba8c4d399a179ce0465"},"time":"06:04"},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:9f1f16843f0ec67a:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":3,"sha256":"9f1f16843f0ec67abeaf35e99492cdc47b32ab2fc074c7993a0133031317f091"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:04","verified":false,"words":"Ramesh, before breakfast: does the estate office work on Sundays, and when does the dhobi come this week? I must settle the file on Monday and the bill on Saturday."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:f94c0685789d030d:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":4,"sha256":"f94c0685789d030d0d373abc1edf1515d29141bd90bb1e1ede20749b8de14715"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"06:04","verified":false,"words":"Office band hai aaj, sir, Monday ko aap aayenge toh kholenge. Dhobi kal subah aayega, ek din pehle aa raha hai is hafte."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:b3556a7d4541a9d3:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":6,"sha256":"b3556a7d4541a9d31fae1ea8c208ae7a1e19c126e21c06a75110633cdb1ff80d"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"06:14","verified":false,"words":"Very good, Ramesh. Then breakfast at seven, and after it I shall walk in the garden while the air is clear. Keep the dhobi’s bill ready for tomorrow, and let me see it before he leaves."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:d2f2ed5b90c3d588:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":7,"sha256":"d2f2ed5b90c3d588d4e9bd511301622cc6f16c1ed00b7938cf8089386ebed5c2"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"06:14","verified":false,"words":"Haan sir, chhaay ke baad main garden ki side khol dunga. Dhobi ka bill main abhi apke study table par rakhta hoon, aap subah check kar lein."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:14a2b0267a81fe6a:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":9,"sha256":"14a2b0267a81fe6a15928d1cfc0e2a2a22468e22c70d3c10377db843ed0be6b8"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:00","verified":false,"words":"Bahut accha, Ramesh. I shall look at the bill after breakfast; the garden side may wait until the shade is gone."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:d360cb9b57b6d09c:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":10,"sha256":"d360cb9b57b6d09ce1c12e05c648688becca56f67422f4c20d72ecb0b500a424"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:00","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir. Aloo paratha garam hai, curd aur achaar bhi table par hai. Aap aaram se khaayein."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:9ef3dd854d9bb546:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":12,"sha256":"9ef3dd854d9bb54622b75676880548fdbff4b7957098f01494b5f4bebc3dcdf7"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:30","verified":false,"words":"Bahut accha, Ramesh. Leave it as it is; I shall take it slowly, and you may sit if you are not wanted elsewhere."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:1d0ee86fdee419a0:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":13,"sha256":"1d0ee86fdee419a02a8a1ddbd20ddd5b69662dd1e023a3aeda07c49decf11580"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:30","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir, main bas ek minute. Ghar wale ka phone aaya tha, unhe bol ke aata hoon. Aap aaram se khaayein, main turant wapas aa jaunga."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:4bf7c1481e406476:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Ramesh","source":{"collection":"entries","index":15,"sha256":"4bf7c1481e40647633063146f4da65a63d20eac97ebb5b0df382879387251eee"},"speaker":"Hegel","time":"07:55","verified":false,"words":"Bilkul, Ramesh. No hurry."},{"id":"2026-10-04:statement:748f020a7777a60e:1","kind":"statement","place":"home","recipient":"Hegel","source":{"collection":"entries","index":16,"sha256":"748f020a7777a60ef7ae5635296dad04fcd803db91a0ed370fbffbf5c812e88c"},"speaker":"Ramesh","time":"07:55","verified":false,"words":"Ji sir, aap aaram se khaayein. Main bas bahar aata hoon."},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:ed74cbb2c83dc605:1","intended_time":"07:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":0,"sha256":"ed74cbb2c83dc605435db69ca331fc213ccab9a4667638dc315dca436c2aa5f1"},"status":"planned","text":"Have breakfast, and ask Ramesh what the estate office does on Sundays and when the dhobi comes.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:10ff9f38c2a45ff5:1","intended_time":"08:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":1,"sha256":"10ff9f38c2a45ff54898a6fa27d5dc6d89c47678dbf7ee1cdb2cbf50c5bc85a9"},"status":"planned","text":"Walk in Lodhi Gardens while the air is clear, and let the file's contradiction settle.","time":"06:04","type":"intention"},{"id":"2026-10-04:event:7abcaedbd0763990:1","intended_time":"10:00","kind":"event","place":null,"source":{"collection":"plan.items","index":2,"sha256":"7abcaedbd07639906cfcbafdbfdbbf459afe848af057ead3db4d9410d4b45d27"},"status":"planned","text":"Read the file at home on the misdescription, noting where sign and Notion part.","time":"06:04","type"